  <p id="c-jinshu-010-xieyu-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">丁丑，以吏部尚書<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyu-death:p001:m0008" ref="684_eaa_511">謝裕</persName>爲尚書左僕射。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-010-xieyu-death:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">八月丁未，尚書左僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyu-death:p002:m0010" ref="684_eaa_511">謝裕</persName>卒，以尚書右僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyu-death:p002:m0020" ref="255_233_b52">劉穆之</persName>爲尚書左僕射。</p>
